# {{project-name}}

Architecture: full-stack Python web application.

Implementation stack: FastAPI backend with SQLAlchemy and Alembic, plus a React, Vite, TypeScript, Tailwind, Radix UI, lucide-react, and react-router-dom frontend.

## Layout

- `backend/`: FastAPI app, database models, Alembic migrations, and backend tests
- `frontend/`: React app served by Vite

## Local Development

Run the backend from `backend/` and the frontend from `frontend/`.

```bash
cd backend
uv sync --group dev
uv run uvicorn {{package-module}}.main:app --reload
```

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
